orterman", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198132556831/", "num_games_owned": 145, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 13304, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1022, "playtime_at_review": 9333, "last_played": 1789242480, "avatar": "4c871827e6543db65a659b9032cf54018e63fca3"}, "language": "english", "review": "fan of the series and played multiple games for gunfire studio, now heres the thing \n\nTHE BAD\n\n1. obtaining items is literally a easter egg simulator, if it was for one or 2 items it wouldve been excusable but this is for the whole ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ game almost especially areas after losomn. shame i didnt get a taste of everything.\n\n2. i dont want to repeat the same ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ map 12+ times to get everything thats a terrible idea. \n\n3. the RNG on prisms is so unnecessary in a single player game its dumb concept. why do i have to reset my prism 4 times coz it gets ruined and finish the game with barely leveled up prism, ONE OUT OF 7 PRISMS. \n\n4. not having the max difficulty as starters is also weird?? i have to repeat places so many times but only on the submax difficulty because i \"didnt finish the story\"\n\n5. items only obtainable in RNG THROUGH THE MAIN CAMPAIGN, that should have whoever thought thats a good idea publicly executed \n\n6. unoptimized game.... come on \n\n\nthe GOOD\n\n1. more items, weapons and \"EVENTS\" that are interesting \n2. exploration and leveling up is also nice\n3. bosses are interesting and require build variety and situational \n4. cool designs \n5. bigger maps \n6. more depth to the game \n7. overall improvement over the first game \n\nDONT PULL THESE MOVES TO DARKSIDERS PLEASE \n\nproblems couldve been fixed easily and theres an easy fix to all what i mentioned bad review to a good game for bad choices made, not to mention NO CLOUD SAVE?! seriously my partner lost a 80 hour save coz of this.", "timestamp_created": 1765824461, "timestamp_updated": 1775775914, "voted_up": true, "vot